{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_04",
  "title": "7:59P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dfb34744ca9e3eb8d44a57b29f93a38c6aab28d3bd6b885b5d2814c2efadd354",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:59 P.M.    天气/多云\n龙门人工河流，码头"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次不要再突然跳到船上了啊！很危险的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，事出有因才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问刚才你有看见一位萨科塔人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没看见啦，真是遭不住，这些糖果可是今晚的后夜派对要用的，要是耽误了你赔得起......唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨、萨科塔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！莫斯提马小——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫斯提马？你认识莫斯提马？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不好意思，是我认错人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这个人，好像在哪里见过？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳嗯，总之这次就先放过你了，下次不要再做这么危险的事情了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱、抱歉，真的是麻烦你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......年轻的丰蹄......总觉得好像忘了什么......是什么呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！？你要做什么！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的角上卡着一颗糖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，真的。是不是该还回去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，看到这对角，我想起来了！和那个峯驰的标志一模一样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是峯驰物流的小少爷，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小、小少爷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空前辈，这条路真的能和德克萨斯小姐他们汇合吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心放心，德克萨斯在想什么，我可是一清二楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这个声音总有种熟悉感，在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“前辈”吗，嘿嘿，想不到我也会有带着信使后辈的一天~你对大家的印象如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "印象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_pgbase_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常，呃，激动人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈......我大概能猜到什么情况了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走路注意点啊！嘁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明是你冲过来的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？关你屁事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这小鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算啦算啦，随他去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是他刚才顺走了你的钱包——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我知道哦，不过那个钱包里只装了南瓜糖就是了。你看，真正的钱包在这儿~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“不给糖就捣蛋”嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他是直接来捣蛋的，而且今天也不是......为什么要特地这么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门最近经历了很多事情，虽然在今天不太看得出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安魂夜的蜡烛照亮不到这座城市的所有角落，这些孩子也太可怜了点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶嘿，不过说到底还是一时兴起啦，不错的主意吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果被偷的是我可怎么办......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面出去，就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_park"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是......刚才的公园？又回到这里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看吧，果然在那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——唔唔唔，唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你再不说，我可就要点火了啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小哥你还是老实招了吧，这个烟花真的能带着你上天的喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们忘了把他嘴上的胶布撕掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉，嘿咻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们这群家伙！你们真的知道我们是什么人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......叙拉古，黑手党。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，德、德克萨斯吗......别以为我们会怕你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道你们不怕啦，毕竟你们把老板的珍藏品全部炸飞了。糖果盒炸弹吗，真是孩子气的陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不知道什么糖果盒，笑话！如果真是首领亲自出手，你们早就被炸成碎片——唔唔！唔唔唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是这家伙也太臭屁了，不如直接把他炸了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有点耐心，能天使，让他说下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗哈——哼，你们就不奇怪为什么龙门根本对我们睁一只眼闭一只眼吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，一般来说除了每个月要去警署报个到把公共财产妨害的罚款结一下，平时也不怎么管我们哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，能天使姐你别打断人家啊，你继续。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你们这样子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一位已经默许了我们对企鹅物流的所有行动，既然都是龙门的灰色势力，你们肯定明白这意味着什么吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们可是有合法运营执照的物流公司哦？而且运营状况其实还不错？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以为什么每次我们都要被当做......唉，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一位，是哪一位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种装腔作势的说法真的太蠢了，透露着一股杂鱼的气息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还装傻！？鼠王可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！德克萨斯！大家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是阿空！喂~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？拜松好像也在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，路上遇到落单的拜松，就把他带来啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们这是在干什么？大帝先生呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板说是有想要确认的事情，就去了别的地方啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空，没有遇见其他人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？没......有吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？看着我干嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没、没什么。总之，事情的来龙去脉我都已经听拜松说了，接下来我们该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先从这家伙嘴里问出点什么，然后对·症·下·药！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下，能天使小姐，那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实，刚才我遇到了莫斯提马小姐。但是，她不见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我的意思是，我们逃避黑手党的包围，然后她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不用担心她，常有的事啦，毕竟她一不留神就能消失好几年嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——好几年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话说，我进了公司之后几乎都没见过她的面喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈，就不要刺激能天使了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这还真是非常的......脱离常识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身为信使，她很特殊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然和老板有着契约关系，但更多的还是她身为拉特兰的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——能天使，别走神，注意你的火柴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔唔——唔唔——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶呀，已经来不及了。算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔唔——！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事，刚才听见了弗伦佐的惨叫声！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那边那个方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的能带着活人飞上天啊，那这烟花还挺劲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先应付敌人，左右分工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
